{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation detail for this story (the description carries the decisions).\n\n### (3) `scripts/check_*.py` single-owner table (33 scripts)\n\n`make lint` (`Makefile:266-439`) runs in CI via `_build-and-test.yml:102`, so a lint-wired script has one owner. Delete = \"real tree is clean\" / \"make lint wires it\" twins (74 collected nodes total); keep = fixture tests on synthetic input.\n\n| script | owner | pytest twin (LOC) | delete | keep |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| check_adr_numbers | docs-gates action `:22` → ADD to `make lint` | `tests/scripts/test_check_adr_numbers{,_heldout}.py` (104+185) | heldout: `test_ci_wires_the_gate`, `test_real_repo_tree_is_clean`, `test_real_tree_has_no_duplicate_numbers`, `test_real_tree_marker_per_adr`, `test_real_check_script_runs_as_subprocess` | all 14 `_valid_tree`/tmp_path tests |\n| check_build_env_locked | `release.yml:184` | `tests/unit/test_check_build_env_locked.py` (128) | — | all 7 |\n| check_cli_json_js_safe | lint `:367` | `test_cli_json_js_safe_guard.py` (246) | `test_the_repository_is_clean`, `test_make_lint_invokes_the_gate` | 11 |\n| check_comment_hygiene | lint `:315` | `test_comment_hygiene_guard.py` (327) | `test_the_real_tree_is_clean` (repo_policy `:267`), `test_make_lint_wires_the_hygiene_gate`, `test_wiring_check_detects_a_removed_invocation` | 20 |\n| check_commit_message_wrap | pre-commit `:78-80` | `test_check_commit_message_wrap.py` (223) | — | all 20 |\n| check_complexity_baseline | lint `:273` | `test_complexity_baseline.py` (1067), `_lock_47e9.py` (181) | `test_raw_json_census_exits_1_with_live_count`, `test_census_transport_exit_zero_same_count`, `test_wrapper_check_on_committed_baseline`, `test_committed_baseline_schema_and_count`, `test_committed_baseline_loads_and_checks_clean`, `test_make_lint_wires_wrapper_and_retains_ruff_format` | rest, incl. `test_src_rebar_has_no_inline_c901_noqa` (the script has no noqa scan) |\n| check_config_ownership | lint `:291` | `tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership{,_heldout}.py` (100+272); `tests/unit/test_config_gate_wiring_heldout.py` (109) | heldout: `test_real_source_tree_is_clean`, `test_main_on_real_tree_returns_zero`; delete `test_config_gate_wiring_heldout.py` whole (6 wiring tests) | 26 |\n| check_config_reads | lint `:292` | `tests/scripts/test_check_config_reads{,_heldout,_red_proof}.py` (164+343+144) | heldout: `test_real_repo_is_clean_with_default_paths`, `test_real_schema_markers_all_carry_pointers`, `test_string_read_fields_keep_their_marker_and_do_not_fire` (4 params, `:260-269`), `test_the_real_schema_parks_no_markers_against_a_ticket`, `test_ci_wires_the_gate` | rest; `_red_proof.py` untouched |\n| check_criteria_vocabulary | lint `:371` | `test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py` (421) | `test_current_repository_vocabulary_is_clean` | 22 |\n| check_dco_identity | lint `:370` | `test_check_dco_identity.py` (127) | — | 6 |\n| check_deploy_manifest | lint `:401` | `test_check_deploy_manifest.py` (263) | `test_passes_against_real_repo`, `test_make_lint_invokes_the_gate` | 16 |\n| check_destructive_test_exec | lint `:334` | `tests/scripts/test_check_destructive_test_exec.py` (216) | `test_repository_tree_is_currently_clean` | 16 |\n| check_docs_index | docs-gates `:59` → ADD `--check` to `make lint` | `test_check_docs_index.py` (359) | `test_current_repo_index_is_clean`, `test_all_docs_relative_links_resolve` | 18 |\n| check_fcntl_import_guard | lint `:382` | `test_fcntl_import_guard.py` (168) | `test_guard_is_clean_on_the_real_tree`, `test_make_lint_invokes_the_guard` | 5 |\n| check_import_walk | typecheck `:505` | `tests/scripts/test_check_import_walk.py` (175) | `TestScriptsLeg::test_real_scripts_leg_passes`, `TestInstalledPackageLeg::test_real_rebar_walk_passes_in_the_dev_venv` | 9 |\n| check_mcp_library_parity | lint `:310` | `test_mcp_library_parity.py` (486) | `test_check_passes_against_the_committed_manifest`, `test_the_committed_manifest_covers_every_live_tool`, `test_cli_check_exits_zero_on_the_committed_tree`, `test_make_lint_runs_the_parity_check` | 23 |\n| check_mechanism_delta | lint `:285` | `test_mechanism_delta.py` (531) | `test_check_passes_on_the_committed_tree`, `test_the_committed_baseline_matches_the_live_tree`, `test_make_lint_runs_the_ratchet`, `test_the_committed_tree_assertions_consult_marker_admission` (meta-test on the two above) | rest incl. the scripts/-size/complexity tests (no other gate scans `scripts/`) |\n| check_orphaned_load | operator diagnostic (docs/orphaned-processes.md) | `tests/scripts/test_check_orphaned_load.py` (315, bug `f3d9-ecd8-df72-4fa1`) | — | all 24 |\n| check_raw_git_writes | lint `:322` | `test_raw_git_write_lint.py` (935) | `test_repo_tree_has_no_unsanctioned_raw_git_writes` | 49 |\n| check_readme_quickstart | docs-gates `:70`, `test.yml:189`, `gerrit-verify.yaml:352` (executes the quickstart; stays CI-owned) | `tests/scripts/test_check_readme_quickstart.py` (135) | `test_extract_real_readme_has_golden_path_commands`, `test_main_runs_real_quickstart_green` | 6 |\n| check_repo_root_from_package | lint `:357` | `test_repo_root_from_package_guard.py` (248) | `test_the_repository_is_clean`, `test_make_lint_invokes_the_gate` | 12 |\n| check_repo_root_from_tracker | lint `:350` | `test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py` (314) | same two names | 17 |\n| check_server_manifest | `_build-and-test.yml` drift step | `tests/scripts/test_check_server_manifest.py` (147) | `test_committed_manifest_matches_complete_canonical_records` | 6 |\n| check_shellcheck | lint `:392` | `test_check_shellcheck.py` (138) | `test_repository_tree_is_currently_clean` | 11 |\n| check_skill_frontmatter | lint `:374` | `test_check_skill_frontmatter.py` (159) | `test_real_tree