 adds that script to `_WIRED_GATES`."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788807430788207041,"uuid":"a912fc37-11d9-49d0-8845-0b92a6ee0013"}